      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0765_line_0016",
      "lineIndex": 16,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਭ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਨਾਮ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਜਾਨਹੁ ॥੮੫੯॥",
      "transliteration": "sabh sree naam tupak ke jaanahu ||859||",
      "translation": "Say firstly the words “Dvaarvati-nayakni”, then add the words “Jaachar-pati-shatru” and in this way know all the names of Tupak.859.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਸਭ ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝੋ ॥੮੫੯॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 765,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सभ स्री नाम तुपक के जानहु ॥८५९॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108170",
      "sourceShabadId": "9547",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0765_line_0017",
      "lineIndex": 17,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਗਤੇਸਰਨਿਨਿ ਆਦਿ ਭਣਿਜੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jagatesaranin aadh bhanijai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਜਗਤੇਸਰਨਿਨਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਦਾ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 765,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जगतेसरनिनि आदि भणिजै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108171",
      "sourceShabadId": "9547",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
