      "transliteration": "satr sabadh ko bahur bakhaano ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਮਗਰੋਂ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।",
